  "notes": "\n1. Filtered AED locations to only include the four target districts (Songshan, Xinyi, Da'an, Zhongshan) using prep.in_area.\n2. Excluded locations categorized as '學校、大型集會場所' and '其他'.\n3. Deduplicated locations using prep.merge_same_place based on name and coordinates to ensure one entry per physical site.\n4. Handled the 'equal team size' constraint by removing (N mod 4) locations if the total count was not divisible by 4.\n5. Computed the pairwise Haversine distance matrix using prep.haversine_matrix.\n",
